WebCore: no image atlases on Minkar

Skia's tile recording packs a layer's images into one GL texture atlas
when it paints four or more (8 px or larger). On Minkar the tile painters
sample that atlas as opaque black, so every such image (a page's no-repeat
backgrounds, icons) showed as a black box. The images are drawn one by
one instead, as with fewer than four.

